   "width": 620.0,
   "height": 280.0,
   "strokeColor": "#EAF4FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "WHY it is unavailable  \u2014  Z-09 says which\nZERADO_NO_AUDIO set   ->  OVERRIDDEN, not 'off'\nno audio device\nover SSH   ->  the sound would play on the wrong machine\nin CI\ninit failed or timed out",
   "originalText": "WHY it is unavailable  \u2014  Z-09 says which\nZERADO_NO_AUDIO set   ->  OVERRIDDEN, not 'off'\nno audio device\nover SSH   ->  the sound would play on the wrong machine\nin CI\ninit failed or timed out",
   "fontSize": 14,
